{"Color palette":"色盤","Lit tiles (every 5th) are safe: floats of any color share them and no captures happen there.":"點亮嘅磚（每 5 次）係安全嘅：任何顏色嘅浮點都會分享佢哋，而且喺嗰度冇任何捕捉。","After a full lap, floats climb their colored approach. The final crown needs an exact roll (unless bounce-back is on).":"完成一圈後，浮標會爬上佢哋顏色嘅進場路。最後嘅皇冠需要精確嘅擲骰（除非反彈功能開啟）。","Tiles bearing a lit lantern are safe: floats of any color may rest there together, and no capture can happen.":"帶有點燃燈籠嘅瓷磚係安全嘅：任何顏色嘅浮標都可以喺嗰度一齊休息，而且唔可以發生捕捉。","After a full lap, floats turn into their colored Grand Approach. Reach the pavilion crown with an exact roll.":"完成一圈後，浮標會轉入佢哋顏色嘅大道。用精確嘅擲骰到達亭閣皇冠。","Player":"玩家","Crown {n} float(s)":"加冕 {n} 架花車","{n} captures":"{n} 捕捉","Win with {n}+ captures":"用 {n} + 捕捉贏","Win without capturing":"冇捕捉就贏","☁ synced":"☁ 已同步","☁ saving…":"☁ 儲存中…","☁ offline":"☁ 離線","Captions for meaningful audio":"重要音效字幕","Camera":"鏡頭","Theme":"主題","Visual theme. Cosmetics never alter rules or hazards.":"視覺主題。化妝品永遠唔會改變規則或者危險。","Pause":"暫停","Undo":"復原","Hint":"提示","Left-handed controls":"左手控制","The CVD palette uses blue/gold separation; player identity also uses shapes and labels.":"CVD 調色板使用藍色/金色分離；玩家身份亦都會用形狀同標籤。","Timing assistance (longer AI pauses, slower banners)":"計時輔助（ AI 暫停時間較長，橫額較慢）","Replay tutorial lessons":"重播教學課程","Auto":"自動","Top":"頂部","Low":"低","↺ Resume saved game":"↺ 恢復已儲存嘅遊戲","{n}/40 stages complete":"{n}/40個階段完成","40 festival stages":"40 個節日關卡","One shared race each day":"每日一場共享比賽","Saved game restored.":"已儲存嘅遊戲已恢復。","Could not restore the saved game.":"無法還原已保存嘅遊戲。","Practice Match":"練習比賽","Daily Circuit":"每日賽道","Journey":"旅程","Challenge":"挑戰","Lesson":"課程","Local Table":"本地表","Set up":"設定","Players":"玩家","AI difficulty":"AI 難度","Floats per player":"每個玩家浮動","Rule variants":"規則變體","Exact finish (overshoot is wasted)":"精確完成（超調係浪費）","Processions (blockades)":"遊行（封鎖）","Lantern safe tiles":"燈籠安全磚","Players at this table":"呢張枱嘅玩家","Pass-and-play: everyone shares this device. Undo is allowed between turns.":"通過同播放：