 all local progress":"清除所有本地進度","Erase all local progress, settings stay. This cannot be undone.":"擦除所有本地進度，設定保持。呢個係復原唔到嘅。","Progress erased.":"進度已清除。","Race four floats from your workshop around the Grand Circuit. A full lap earns the right to climb your Grand Approach — crown all four floats in the pavilion to win.":"喺大賽道周圍由你嘅工作坊賽車四個浮標。一圈就可以贏得你嘅大接近嘅權利 — 將展館入面嘅四個浮標都加冠嚟贏。","Kindling":"點火","Roll a 6 to move a float from the workshop onto your start tile. A 6 also grants an encore roll — but three 6s in a row are overkindled and end your turn.":"滾一個6，將一個浮標由車房移到你嘅起始磚上面。 6 亦都可以獲得安可滾動 — 但係連續三個 6 會被過度點燃，令你嘅回合結束。","Lantern tiles":"燈籠磚","Captures":"捕獲","Land exactly on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it back to its workshop.":"正好落地喺一個普通嘅瓷磚上面嘅對手浮標上面，將佢送返去佢嘅工作坊。","Processions":"遊行","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a wall: rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"你兩個浮標喺一塊普通嘅磚上面形成一幅牆：對手嘅唔可以落地，亦唔可以過佢。","The Approach":"個方法","Controls":"控制","{confirm} roll/confirm · arrows switch float · {undo} undo · {hint} hint · {camera} camera · {board} board text · {pause} pause. Gamepad: ✕/A confirm, ○/B cancel, ☰ pause.":"{confirm} 滾動/確認 · 箭頭開關浮動 · {undo} 復原 · {hint} 提示 · {camera} 相機 · {board} 板文字 · {pause} 暫停。遊戲手柄： ✕ / A 確認， ○ / B 取消， ☰ 暫停。","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"解鎖成就：{name}","Journey {n}":"旅程 {n}","Practice":"練習","Be first to crown {n} float(s).":"最先為 {n} 個浮標加冕。","First to {n} captures wins the stage.":"第一個捕捉到 {n} 嘅人贏咗個舞台。","Win the race with at least {n} captures.":"用至少 {n} 捕捉贏得比賽。","Win without capturing any rival float.":"贏咗，但係冇捕捉到任何對手嘅浮標。","Crown all your floats first. Lantern schedule: {n} rounds.":"首先加冕晒你所有嘅花車。燈籠時間表：{n} 回合。","Crown all your floats first.":"首先加冕晒你所有嘅花車。","{n}-round limit":"{n} 回合限制","No turn limit":"冇轉彎限制","{name} begins — roll!":"{name} 開始 — — 滾動！","Your turn — roll!":"輪到你 — — 滾！","{name} to roll…":"{name} 要滾動⋯","No moves — you must pass.":"冇步可行——你必須跳過。","{name} has no moves.":"{name} 冇動作。","Rolled {n} — choose a float.":"滾動 {n} 