oats} 加冕， {captures} 捕捉","Restart this match from the beginning?":"由頭重新開始呢場比賽？","Leave the game? Solo progress is saved and can be resumed.":"離開遊戲？獨奏進度已經儲存，可以恢復。","That float cannot use this roll.":"嗰個浮點用唔到呢個卷。","Today: won · score {score}":"今日：贏咗 · 得分 {score}","Today: played · score {score}":"今日：已玩 · 得分 {score}","exact finish":"完全完成","bounce finish":"彈完","processions on":"遊行","no processions":"冇遊行","lantern tiles":"燈籠磚","dark circuit":"暗電路","no safe tiles":"冇安全磚","yes — counts for records":"係 — 計嚟記錄","no — practice does not affect rating":"唔係 — 練習唔會影響評分","hints available, undo allowed":"提示可用，允許復原","hints available":"提示可用","Won":"贏咗","Lost":"落敗","Exact finish at the crown":"完全完成喺冠部","Bounce-back finish":"反彈終點","Processions block rivals":"遊行阻擋對手","No processions":"冇遊行","Lantern tiles are safe":"燈籠磚係安全嘅","No safe tiles":"冇安全磚","Captures on":"吃子開啟","Captures off":"吃子關閉","Victory":"勝利","Game over":"遊戲結束","Race your floats around the festival circuit. First to crown all four wins.":"將你嘅浮標喺節日賽道上比賽。首先要冠軍所有四場勝利。","▶ Play":"▶ 開始","Learn":"學習","Interactive lessons":"互動課程","Unranked, undo allowed":"非排名，允許復原","Challenges":"挑戰","Constrained goals":"限制目標","Profile":"個人檔案","Achievements":"成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","How to Play":"玩法說明","Settings":"設定","Back":"返回","Start":"開始","Learn the Circuit":"學電路","Board state (accessible text)":"棋盤狀態（無障礙文字）","Objective":"目標","Turn":"回合","Progress":"進度","Rules":"規則","Roll the festival die":"滾節日死","Roll":"擲","Pass":"唔出","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Restart":"重新開始","Leave Game":"離開遊戲","Done":"完成","Audio":"音效","Graphics":"畫面","Accessibility":"無障礙","Results":"結果","Watch Replay":"睇重播","Retry":"重試","Close":"關閉","Daily":"每日","All-time":"歷來","Board State":"棋盤狀態","Are you sure?":"你係咪肯定？","Cancel":"取消","Confirm":"確認","Lantern Pavilion":"燈籠閣","Jade Garden":"翡翠花園","Ember Court":"餘燼庭院","Moonlight Dock":"月光碼頭","Blossom Fête":"花開慶典","Kindling a Float":"點燃浮標","Your floats begin in the workshop. Roll a 6 — a full kindle — to send one onto the circuit. The festival die is scripted for this lesson.":"你嘅花車喺工作坊入面開始。滾一個 6 — 一個完整嘅 kindle — 將一個送入電路。節日死亡係呢堂課嘅劇本。","Roll the festival die.":"滾節日死。","You rolled a 6! Choose a float to kindle it onto your start tile.":"你碌咗個6！揀一個浮點，將佢點燃喺你嘅起始圖塊上面。","Well done — a kindled float also grants an encore roll.":"做得好好 — 一個點燃嘅浮標亦都會畀到一個安可卷。","Around the Circuit":"環繞賽道","Floats travel the full circuit. Your rival will take turns with you.":"浮點行咗成個電路。你嘅對手會輪流同你一齊。","Roll the die.":"滾骰子。","Kindle a float onto the circuit.":"將浮點點燃到電路上面。","Encore! Roll again.":"安可啦！再滾一次。","Move your float along the circuit.":"沿住個電路移動你嘅浮子。","Your rival now takes a turn. Turns alternate unless a 6 grants an encore.":"你嘅對手而家要轉身。除非 6 授予安可，否則會輪流轉。","Lantern Tiles":"燈籠磚","A rival float waits on the lantern tile ahead. Roll.":"一個對手嘅浮標喺前方嘅燈籠格上等緊。擲骰。","Move onto the lantern tile — you will share it peacefully.":"移去燈籠磚上面 — 你會和平噉分享佢。","See? Both floats share the lantern tile. Safe tiles never capture.":"見到？兩個浮標都係共用燈籠磚。安全磚永遠唔會捕捉到。","The Capture":"捕捉","Land on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it all the way back to its workshop.":"落地喺一個普通嘅磚上面嘅對手浮標上面，將佢一路送返去佢嘅工作坊。","A rival float rests three tiles ahead, unguarded. Roll.":"一個對手嘅浮標喺前方三格，無人防守。擲骰。","Land exactly on it to send it home!":"正好落地送佢返屋企！","Captured! Rival floats return to their workshop and must be kindled again.":"被捕捉！敵方浮體會返回佢哋嘅工坊，必須重新點燃。","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a procession. Rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"你兩個浮標喺一塊普通嘅磚上面組成一個行列。對手嘅唔可以落喺佢上面，亦唔可以過佢。","Roll, then bring your floats together.":"滾動，然後將你嘅浮標帶埋一齊。","Move the rear float onto its companion (tile 6).":"將後面嘅浮標移到佢嘅同伴上面（磚6）。","A procession! Now roll again for your rival to feel it… actually, feel free to move on.":"一個巡遊！而家再擲一次令你嘅對手感受吓……其實，你隨時可以繼續。","Move any float. Remember: rivals cannot cross your procession.":"移動任何浮點。記住：對手唔可以越過你嘅行列。","Processions are walls. Break yours up when it blocks your own plans.":"遊行係牆。當你嘅計劃阻礙你自己嘅計劃嗰陣，就打破你嘅計劃。","The Grand Approach":"大方法","Your float is on the approach, three steps from the crown. Roll.":"你嘅浮標喺嚟緊，距離個冠三步。捲。","An exact 3 — guide it to the crown!":"精確3——引導佢去皇冠！","Crowned! Crown all four floats to sweep the circuit and win.":"加冕！加冕晒四架花車嚟橫掃賽道贏波。","First Lanterns":"第一燈籠","Open Causeway":"開放銅鑼灣","Rival at Dusk":"黃昏時分嘅對手","Double Time":"雙倍時間","Mastery: Kindling":"精通：點燃","Lantern Watch":"燈籠錶","Shared Shelter":"共用避難所","First Blood":"第一滴血","Escort Duty":"護送任務","Mastery: Shelter":"掌握：避難所","Two Deep":"雙深","The Long Wall":"長牆．","Breakthrough":"突破","Wall and Blade":"牆同刀刃","Mastery: Processions":"掌握：遊行","Home Stretch":"最後衝刺","Exact Measure":"精確測量","Bounce Step":"彈跳步","Bounce-back finish: overshoot reflects down the approach.":"反彈終點：衝過頭會沿住滑道反射落嚟。","Crown Guard":"皇冠守衛","Win by captures: send three rival floats home first.":"以捕捉取勝：先送三個對手浮標返屋企。","Mastery: The Approach":"掌握：方法","Three Lamps":"三盞燈","A strict lantern schedule: finish before the turn limit.":"一個嚴格嘅燈籠時間表：喺回合限制前完成。","Crossroads":"十字路口","Encore Line":"安可線","Festival Rush":"節日趕","Mastery: Three Ways":"精通：三個方法","Short Circuit":"短路","Fewer floats, tighter schedule.":"少啲浮點，更緊張嘅時間表。","Swift Crown":"斯威夫特皇冠","Tight Reins":"緊鎖","Twin Floats":"雙浮標","Mastery: Economy":"熟練度：經濟","Four Lamps":"四盞燈","Crowded Ring":"擠迫嘅圈","No Shelter":"冇避難所","The lanterns are dark — nowhere is safe.":"啲燈籠係黑暗嘅 — 冇地方係安全嘅。","Long Night":"漫長夜晚","Mastery: Grand Fête":"掌握：大節日","Ember Trial":"餘燼試煉","The final trials of the Royal Circuit.":"皇家巡回法院嘅最後審判。","Jade Trial":"玉審判","Azure Trial":"蔚藍試煉","Gilded Trial":"鍍金試驗","Mastery: Royal Circuit":"精通：皇家賽道","Lantern Sprint":"燈籠衝刺","Win in 24 rounds or fewer. Every roll must count.":"喺24回合或以下贏。每卷都要計","Pacifist Parade":"和平主義大遊行","Win without capturing a single rival float.":"贏咗，但係冇捕捉到一個對手嘅浮標。","Float Hunter":"浮標獵人","Land at least 5 captures on the way to victory.":"喺勝利嘅路上，至少可以捕捉到5次。","Photo Finish":"壓線衝刺","Bounce-back rules against a master rival. Overshoots reflect.":"對住大師級對手嘅反彈規則。衝過頭會反射。","Dark Circuit":"黑黯迴路","No lantern tiles. Every tile is dangerous.":"冇燈籠磚。每塊磚都好危險。","Grand Melee":"大混戰","Four master floats, one circuit, fifty rounds.":"四主浮，一圈，五十發。","First Crown":"第一個皇冠","Crown your first float.":"加冕你第一架花車。","Circuit Victor":"迴路勝者","Win your first game.":"贏你第一場遊戲。","Lantern Snuffer":"燈籠嗅探器","Land 10 captures in total.":"總共10次捕捉。","Pilgrim of the Ring":"魔戒朝聖者","Complete 20 journey stages.":"完成 20 個旅程關卡。","Master of the Circuit":"循環大師","Complete all 40 journey stages.":"完成全部 40 個旅程關卡。","Three Dusks Running":"三個黃昏跑","Play the daily challenge 3 days in a row.":"連續玩 3 日每日挑戰。","Untouchable":"無法觸及","Win a game without any float being sent home.":"贏一場比賽，冇任何浮標被送返屋企。","Festival Scholar":"節日學者","Complete every lesson.":"完成每一課。","Hundred Circuits":"一百個電路","Complete 100 games across any mode. (Counts every mode equally — no grind advantage.)":"完成 100 場任何模式嘅遊戲。（每個模式都一樣計——冇刷分優勢。）","Casual":"悠閒","Paper Crane":"紙鶴","Tea Monk":"茶僧","Kite Child":"風箏孩子","Skilled":"熟練","Lantern Keeper":"守燈人","Drum Major":"鼓少校","Silk Dancer":"絲舞者","Master":"大師","Pavilion Sage":"亭子賢人","Ember Herald":"灰燼先驱","Moon Regent":"月亮攝政","It is not your turn.":"未輪到你。","That action is not available right now.":"該操作而家唔可用。","That float does not exist.":"嗰個浮點唔存在。","A float needs a 6 to leave the workshop.":"一個浮標需要6先可以離開車間。","That float is already crowned.":"嗰個浮標已經加冕喇。","The roll overshoots the crown — it must fit exactly.":"個轆超過咗個冠 — 佢一定要啱晒。","An opposing procession blocks the way.":"對面嘅隊伍阻住咗去路。","You have a legal move, so you cannot pass.":"你有合法動作，所以你過唔到。","The game is over.":"比賽完咗。","The game has moved on — refresh the state.":"遊戲已經繼續 — 刷新狀態。","That command is not valid.":"嗰個指令無效。","Unknown player seat.":"未知玩家座位。","soft paper tick":"軟紙刻度","wooden tok":"木製嘅托克","muted error thud":"靜音錯誤砰","die rattle":"死嘎嘎嘎","wooden steps":"木階","match strike and warm chime":"比賽罷工同暖鐘","dramatic drum hit":"戲劇性嘅鼓聲","bright bell arpeggio":"明亮嘅鐘聲琶音","rising sparkle":"升起嘅閃光","sad slide and poof":"悲傷嘅滑梯同噗","soft breath whoosh":"柔和嘅呼吸呼呼","gentle paper slide":"溫柔嘅紙片","festival fanfare":"節日歡呼",